  "phase3_gemini_self_healing": {
    "forensics": "The losing cluster is primarily driven by a toxic combination of tight-stop whipsaws (0.45%\u20130.65% adverse excursions on INFY, ITC, and NTPC) during the post-10:30 IST mid-morning liquidity drop-off, alongside severe correlation clustering on 2026-10-22 where 5 consecutive LONG positions failed simultaneously during a broader market sell-off. Furthermore, trades #4 (ICICIBANK) and #10 (AXISBANK) exited with positive gross P&L (+0.12%) via premature breakeven stop triggers at 1.0R, only to turn into net losses due to NSE statutory transaction and brokerage fee drag exceeding the micro-gains.",
    "learning": "In Indian NSE cash equities on a \u20b910,000 capital base, a 0.45% minimum stop-loss sits cleanly inside normal 5-minute bid-ask and mean-reversion noise, while a 1.0R breakeven trigger chokes winning trades before they can clear the ~0.15% round-trip transaction cost hurdle; widening initial stops to 0.60% and delaying breakeven shifts to 1.25R is essential to survive intraday volatility and overcome fee drag.",
    "parameter_patch": {
      "min_target_pct": 1.5,
      "min_sweep_vol_multiplier": 2.4,
      "breakeven_trigger_r": 1.25,
      "min_sl_pct": 0.6
    },
    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #33 Post-Mortem & Parameter Mutation\nForensic analysis of Cycle #33 (PF: 0.61, Win Rate: 33.3%) revealed two critical microstructure bottlenecks: premature stop-outs within normal 5m NSE equity noise (~0.45%\u20130.60% oscillations) and fee-induced net losses on trades stopped out at breakeven after hitting 1.0R (e.g., ICICIBANK, AXISBANK). Additionally, unhedged directional clustering on Oct 22 caused five simultaneous long stop-outs during mid-morning trend exhaustion. To remediate this, we are widening `min_sl_pct` from 0.45% to 0.60% to clear intraday stop-hunting zones, elevating `min_target_pct` to 1.50% to maintain asymmetric reward-to-risk post-fees, pushing `breakeven_trigger_r` to 1.25R to ensure locked-in stops comfortably clear NSE statutory fee hurdles, and tightening entry selectivity via `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` at 2.40x to filter out low-conviction mid-day liquidity sweeps."
